WEBVTT

1
00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.529
Previously on Raising Kanan...

2
00:00:28.696 --> 00:00:30.096
I need the cash. and I need it now.

3
00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:32.007
You find someone to take
this shit off my hands.

4
00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.885
and I'll make sure you get
a nice cut of the dough.

5
00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.619
I may have a buyer from overseas.

6
00:00:35.786 --> 00:00:37.830
who'd be interested in it.

7
00:00:37.997 --> 00:00:39.077
Who's supplying your horse?

8
00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:40.958
You just want my heron connect?

9
00:00:41.125 --> 00:00:42.285
Why the fuck didn't just ask?

10
00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:43.736
Why we got to go through all this?

11
00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:47.590
Now give me the fucking name.
or I'ma load this shit up.

12
00:00:47.757 --> 00:00:49.759
My parents are saying
I can never see you again.

13
00:00:49.925 --> 00:00:51.177
Your parents are right. Aisha.

14
00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:52.595
you shouldn't be with me.

15
00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:53.947
Those police still trying to scare you?

16
00:00:53.971 --> 00:00:55.473
They said another neighbor

17
00:00:55.598 --> 00:00:58.309
saw a Black guy
coming out of the house.

18
00:00:58.434 --> 00:00:59.810
What you do?

19
00:00:59.935 --> 00:01:01.496
Guess I'ma need you to get
the cop to look into it.

20
00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.606
Anything Baptiste touched
is potentially tainted.

21
00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:06.025
I didn't know they were
gonna have him killed.

22
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:09.195
- Who made the call?
- Ishmael and Stephanie Henry.

23
00:01:09.361 --> 00:01:10.988
- Snaps and Pop.
- They killed Fame?

24
00:01:11.155 --> 00:01:12.490
With some help from the police.

25
00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.259
And no side hustles
this time around. Breeze.

26
00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:15.868
Your work is our work.

27
00:01:15.993 --> 00:01:18.162
- Who are you?
- Y'all fucking with me now.

28
00:01:18.746 --> 00:01:21.123
I kept my dad from
beatin' you to fuckin' death

29
00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:22.416
because I thought-

30
00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:23.977
I thought maybe there was more to this.

31
00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.336
You ain't about shit. Kanan.

32
00:01:25.503 --> 00:01:27.338
I panicked. I didn't know what to do.

33
00:01:27.505 --> 00:01:29.673
Nah. you ain't panic.
you protected Kanan.

34
00:01:29.799 --> 00:01:31.550
I'm all fucked up out here. Lou-Lou.

35
00:01:31.717 --> 00:01:33.219
I don't even know what I'm doin'.

36
00:01:33.384 --> 00:01:37.598
Anybody fucks with my
tenants. they fuck with me.

37
00:01:37.765 --> 00:01:39.683
We already cut Raq off at the knees.

38
00:01:39.809 --> 00:01:41.644
I want her cut off at the fucking neck.

39
00:01:41.811 --> 00:01:43.854
We have found another partner.

40
00:01:43.979 --> 00:01:45.582
You fuckin' with Stefano and all of them?

41
00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:46.966
He makin' you kick me to the curb.

42
00:01:47.066 --> 00:01:48.734
You don't know shit
about where I'm from.

43
00:01:48.859 --> 00:01:50.194
You about to find out.

44
00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.130
How many more wars you
tryin' to have at the same time?

45
00:01:52.154 --> 00:01:53.656
As many as it take to win.

46
00:01:54.907 --> 00:01:57.283
- I don't have time for this.
- Ain't gonna take long.

47
00:02:02.081 --> 00:02:03.165
You gon' put down Raq?

48
00:02:03.332 --> 00:02:04.917
It's about showin' who the fuck we are.

49
00:02:05.084 --> 00:02:07.753
- I appreciate the opportunity.
- Best of luck Jarita.

50
00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:09.128
You. too.

51
00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.257
You workin' with Raq?
I got beef with her.

52
00:02:11.423 --> 00:02:13.801
And who the fuck are you. exactly?

53
00:02:13.926 --> 00:02:15.219
Her son.

54
00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:58.697
When you hustlin'.

55
00:03:58.864 --> 00:04:00.741
you ain't thinkin' about nobody but you.

56
00:04:01.784 --> 00:04:05.788
You tellin' yourself it's for
all your peoples. your family.

57
00:04:06.372 --> 00:04:08.123
but fuck outta here with all that.

58
00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:10.167
This about you. nigga.

59
00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.836
Always been about you.

60
00:04:13.712 --> 00:04:15.005
But when shit get ill.

61
00:04:15.923 --> 00:04:18.175
that's when you start
thinkin' about your people.

62
00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:21.470
You worry they gonna
pay for what you did.

63
00:04:22.554 --> 00:04:24.765
That they gonna die behind your bullshit.

64
00:04:25.683 --> 00:04:28.852
So you don't sleep. don't eat.

65
00:04:29.687 --> 00:04:31.647
damn near don't even breathe.

66
00:04:32.481 --> 00:04:34.525
And you keep asking yourself
the same shit

67
00:04:34.692 --> 00:04:38.028
over and over and over again.

68
00:04:39.488 --> 00:04:41.490
What the fuck did I do?

69
00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:43.951
What the fuck did I do?

70
00:04:58.048 --> 00:05:00.676
She and her brother must die.

71
00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:07.224
Well. look. first let
me express my condolences.

72
00:05:07.725 --> 00:05:11.228
I mean. when you're
in our line of work. we-

73
00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.189
We often lose sight
of the-the human cost.

74
00:05:14.356 --> 00:05:18.027
And. frankly. that's-that's
the highest price we pay.

75
00:05:19.069 --> 00:05:25.242
So I'm-I'm sorry for your loss.
and it's a fucking tragedy.

76
00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:27.995
I am concerned

77
00:05:28.579 --> 00:05:31.874
that killing her might offend
your colleague in Manhattan.

78
00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:34.877
And I don't want that kind of trouble.

79
00:05:35.044 --> 00:05:38.964
Without you and the Colombian.
Raq's business is done.

80
00:05:39.465 --> 00:05:40.632
Fini. Kaput.

81
00:05:41.008 --> 00:05:42.718
And if her business is dead.

82
00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:45.387
she's of no use to Pino Bernardi.

83
00:05:47.139 --> 00:05:48.932
If you ain't a paycheck for Pino.

84
00:05:49.641 --> 00:05:51.351
you ain't worth his while.

85
00:05:57.608 --> 00:06:01.028
Let me handle her. Hafiz.

86
00:06:02.488 --> 00:06:03.822
I owe Raq and her brother

87
00:06:03.989 --> 00:06:06.158
bullets to the head for quite a while.

88
00:06:07.743 --> 00:06:09.620
Time to pay off that debt.

89
00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:16.125
John.

90
00:06:17.252 --> 00:06:18.629
She tell you what it's about?

91
00:06:19.046 --> 00:06:20.964
Just said we need to meet.

92
00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.969
You hittin' that?

93
00:06:26.845 --> 00:06:28.347
I keep tellin' you.

94
00:06:28.514 --> 00:06:30.575
ain't nothin' like that been
goin' on between me and Flossie.

95
00:06:30.599 --> 00:06:32.183
Ain't no judgment here. nigga.

96
00:06:32.351 --> 00:06:34.287
Just tryin' to see if you got
a close enough connect to her

97
00:06:34.311 --> 00:06:36.539
that could help us smooth out
any shit that might be rough.

98
00:06:36.563 --> 00:06:39.066
We just talk. that's all.

99
00:06:39.691 --> 00:06:41.068
Here she come.

100
00:06:43.112 --> 00:06:45.948
How can anyone live
anywhere but New York?

101
00:06:48.325 --> 00:06:49.701
I don't get it.

102
00:06:50.994 --> 00:06:53.622
So your son broke into
my apartment last night.

103
00:06:54.456 --> 00:06:56.351
I don't know if he was there
to kill me or scare me.

104
00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:58.168
and I don't care one way or the other.

105
00:06:58.919 --> 00:07:02.089
Look. Kanan just a confused.
angry kid who...

106
00:07:03.549 --> 00:07:05.029
He told me he swapped out those drugs

107
00:07:05.175 --> 00:07:06.260
that killed the judge.

108
00:07:06.426 --> 00:07:08.637
And he also told me that you knew.

109
00:07:09.972 --> 00:07:11.306
You lied to me.

110
00:07:13.934 --> 00:07:15.352
Did you know?

111
00:07:20.899 --> 00:07:21.899
We're done.

112
00:07:22.276 --> 00:07:24.695
I've already let Pino Bernardi know.

113
00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:28.323
I'm gonna miss talking to you. Marvin.

114
00:07:29.199 --> 00:07:31.577
Our conversations meant a lot to me.

115
00:07:33.662 --> 00:07:34.830
Me too.

116
00:07:40.419 --> 00:07:41.837
This shit can be fixed.

117
00:07:42.004 --> 00:07:44.590
Your brother is the only
reason you're not dead already.

118
00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:46.508
So don't press your luck.

119
00:07:52.306 --> 00:07:53.932
Your girl just fucked us.

120
00:07:54.808 --> 00:07:58.478
Nah. we fucked ourselves.

121
00:08:01.148 --> 00:08:03.275
I told you I was gonna scare her.

122
00:08:03.859 --> 00:08:04.859
That's what I did.

123
00:08:04.902 --> 00:08:06.195
But you didn't scare her. Kanan.

124
00:08:06.361 --> 00:08:07.738
You pissed her off.

125
00:08:07.905 --> 00:08:10.324
And Flossie Siegal ain't
someone you wanna piss off.

126
00:08:12.034 --> 00:08:14.036
I wanted her to stop working with Raq.

127
00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:15.996
and that's what she gon' do.

128
00:08:16.872 --> 00:08:19.750
And she was real clear she
wasn't gon' do nothin' to you.

129
00:08:20.167 --> 00:08:21.335
You good.

130
00:08:26.173 --> 00:08:29.593
You said that you and me
are the same. but we not.

131
00:08:31.094 --> 00:08:33.931
I'm not like you. I'm not like this.

132
00:08:34.472 --> 00:08:36.850
The fuck did you think was gon' happen

133
00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:38.894
when I walked in there with my gat out?

134
00:08:39.061 --> 00:08:40.830
I don't know. I don't know
why I started helping you

135
00:08:40.854 --> 00:08:42.231
with this shit in the first place.

136
00:08:42.397 --> 00:08:45.067
This whole thing with you
has fucked with my head.

137
00:08:48.904 --> 00:08:51.615
You was all sweet and nice to me.

138
00:08:51.782 --> 00:08:53.009
I didn't. I didn't. I didn't believe it.

139
00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:54.243
I didn't believe you.

140
00:08:54.826 --> 00:08:57.704
But then once you told me
you was playin' me.

141
00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.582
I started to trust you.

142
00:09:02.918 --> 00:09:05.420
Treat me good and I don't trust you.

143
00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:06.755
Lie to me and I do.

144
00:09:06.922 --> 00:09:08.316
What the fuck does that say about me?

145
00:09:08.340 --> 00:09:10.884
I mean. how much do I hate myself?

146
00:09:12.594 --> 00:09:14.721
Obviously. I think
that I deserve to be lied to.

147
00:09:14.888 --> 00:09:17.015
deserve to be played with.
treat me like shit

148
00:09:17.140 --> 00:09:19.893
and I'll even help you set up my boss.

149
00:09:20.185 --> 00:09:21.853
who kills people.

150
00:09:22.437 --> 00:09:26.608
Like I said. Flossie ain't gonna
do shit to you. Jarita.

151
00:09:27.609 --> 00:09:30.487
But I ain't got time to listen
to all this noise right now.

152
00:09:36.785 --> 00:09:38.287
Fuck you. Kanan.

153
00:09:41.164 --> 00:09:42.874
Fuck you too. bitch.

154
00:09:44.126 --> 00:09:47.004
That shit between us
wasn't ever real anyway.

155
00:09:53.135 --> 00:09:54.636
We gonna hit that pawnshop.

156
00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:56.972
Knock that shit to the fuckin' ground!

157
00:09:57.139 --> 00:09:58.515
Fuck Stefano. fuck Snaps.

158
00:09:58.682 --> 00:10:00.892
fuck Pop. fuck Breeze. fuck all of 'em.

159
00:10:01.059 --> 00:10:02.394
Fuck Kanan too. though.

160
00:10:03.145 --> 00:10:06.315
We go in blastin' and he there.
he gonna get dropped.

161
00:10:08.191 --> 00:10:10.944
See. you want to be at war
with all these niggas.

162
00:10:11.111 --> 00:10:13.196
but you real choosy on who we killin'.

163
00:10:13.697 --> 00:10:14.990
Kanan still a kid. Marvin.

164
00:10:15.157 --> 00:10:16.634
He don't know what the fuck he doin'.

165
00:10:16.658 --> 00:10:17.826
D-Wiz was a kid.

166
00:10:18.285 --> 00:10:20.203
So was that bike nigga we put down.

167
00:10:20.954 --> 00:10:22.748
And Scrap wasn't even much older
than Kanan.

168
00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.584
Don't seem like you got a issue
killin' other people kids.

169
00:10:25.751 --> 00:10:26.831
You wanna kill your nephew?

170
00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:28.337
Is that what you want?

171
00:10:28.503 --> 00:10:30.463
I don't want nothin'
to do with none of this shit.

172
00:10:30.589 --> 00:10:32.507
But I'm in too deep now
to get the fuck out.

173
00:10:32.674 --> 00:10:35.344
so. I'ma follow your lead.

174
00:10:35.510 --> 00:10:37.512
until we get to wherever
the fuck we goin'.

175
00:10:37.679 --> 00:10:40.349
Hit the pawn shop
and bring Kanan to me.

176
00:10:44.186 --> 00:10:46.396
You'd do the same shit if it was Juke.

177
00:10:55.322 --> 00:10:57.157
This shit is a fuckin' mess.

178
00:11:05.374 --> 00:11:06.666
Detective Garcia.

179
00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:08.460
Come on in.

180
00:11:29.147 --> 00:11:30.607
Just got word.

181
00:11:31.274 --> 00:11:33.151
The Thomases are fair game.

182
00:11:35.695 --> 00:11:38.115
Raq and her brother
ain't got no friends no more.

183
00:11:38.281 --> 00:11:39.825
So it's open season.

184
00:11:42.619 --> 00:11:44.538
Stefano wants us to handle it.

185
00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.040
But you and Kanan gon' do the work.

186
00:11:51.420 --> 00:11:53.255
It's Kanan's fam. though.

187
00:11:55.549 --> 00:11:57.217
It's a lot to ask.

188
00:11:58.301 --> 00:12:00.262
This will be a good
measuring stick for him.

189
00:12:00.387 --> 00:12:03.181
Young Kanan is always
sayin' he's with us.

190
00:12:03.723 --> 00:12:06.268
Time to put some walk
behind all that talk.

191
00:12:07.269 --> 00:12:08.687
You gon' take out Raq.

192
00:12:09.438 --> 00:12:11.565
Don't wanna take a chance
on Kanan freezin' up

193
00:12:11.731 --> 00:12:13.066
when it comes to his mother.

194
00:12:13.692 --> 00:12:16.903
But we gonna insist that
Kanan pull a trigger here.

195
00:12:17.779 --> 00:12:21.241
We need to see how committed
and dedicated he really is.

196
00:12:22.242 --> 00:12:23.910
Kanan's with us. man.

197
00:12:24.995 --> 00:12:27.205
That don't necessarily mean
he gone be cool

198
00:12:27.372 --> 00:12:29.583
with droppin' his own peoples.

199
00:12:29.749 --> 00:12:31.543
We his peoples now.

200
00:12:32.461 --> 00:12:34.921
He got a problem with it.
then he's the problem.

201
00:12:35.088 --> 00:12:37.799
And Kanan knows
how we handle problems.

202
00:12:41.887 --> 00:12:43.180
A number of people say

203
00:12:43.346 --> 00:12:44.824
that they saw you having
a heated conversation

204
00:12:44.848 --> 00:12:47.476
with Captain Baptiste
at his retirement party.

205
00:12:47.601 --> 00:12:49.060
In light of his suicide.

206
00:12:49.227 --> 00:12:50.787
we're wondering what the subject matter

207
00:12:50.812 --> 00:12:53.815
of that conversation
was and whether it might

208
00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:56.902
give us some sense of Captain
Baptiste's mental state.

209
00:12:58.945 --> 00:13:00.989
Honestly. I don't even remember.

210
00:13:01.948 --> 00:13:03.366
We were just talking shit.

211
00:13:04.534 --> 00:13:06.934
Baptiste owed me some money off
some bet we made on the Jets.

212
00:13:07.037 --> 00:13:09.039
and I was giving him a hard time about it.

213
00:13:09.331 --> 00:13:10.331
That's all.

214
00:13:10.665 --> 00:13:12.334
Captain Baptiste gamble regularly?

215
00:13:12.501 --> 00:13:15.212
No. no. it wasn't anything like that.

216
00:13:16.421 --> 00:13:19.090
It was for dinner at
Peter Luger or some bullshit.

217
00:13:20.383 --> 00:13:23.512
Captain Baptiste was under
investigation for corruption

218
00:13:23.678 --> 00:13:27.182
by our office as well as the
F.B.I.. Detective Garcia.

219
00:13:27.724 --> 00:13:29.226
Any insight on him

220
00:13:29.392 --> 00:13:31.632
that you might be able to
provide us would be invaluable.

221
00:13:31.770 --> 00:13:33.146
Get the hell out of here.

222
00:13:34.189 --> 00:13:36.566
Baptiste was about as
by the book as you get.

223
00:13:38.568 --> 00:13:40.695
Depends on what book
you're talking about.

224
00:13:42.531 --> 00:13:43.532
Look.

225
00:13:44.199 --> 00:13:45.992
Captain Baptiste was good to me.

226
00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:48.912
I don't have a bad word to say about him.

227
00:13:49.454 --> 00:13:50.789
Far as I'm concerned.

228
00:13:50.914 --> 00:13:53.875
he was a great cop
and an even better man.

229
00:14:47.429 --> 00:14:50.015
Thought you didn't want
to fuck with me no more.

230
00:14:51.266 --> 00:14:52.267
I don't.

231
00:14:52.851 --> 00:14:54.477
but I know who killed Fame.

232
00:15:04.487 --> 00:15:06.072
Is was Snaps and Pop.

233
00:15:09.409 --> 00:15:11.494
They was worried he was
talkin' to the police.

234
00:15:12.245 --> 00:15:13.705
Where you hear that?

235
00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:15.999
I got somebody who knows.

236
00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:18.668
The shit's true.

237
00:15:23.882 --> 00:15:26.134
You down to make this right
for Fame. or not?

238
00:15:35.435 --> 00:15:36.895
I just told you

239
00:15:38.146 --> 00:15:41.566
that I know who killed your best friend.

240
00:15:42.859 --> 00:15:45.070
and you ain't got nothin' to say?

241
00:15:47.447 --> 00:15:49.949
You told me before I wasn't about shit.

242
00:15:51.826 --> 00:15:53.119
now you lookin' for an assist.

243
00:15:53.286 --> 00:15:55.246
I ain't lookin' for shit. nigga.

244
00:15:57.332 --> 00:15:58.809
I'm just tryin' to give you the chance

245
00:15:58.833 --> 00:16:00.377
to get payback for your boy.

246
00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:03.963
- Fame always talked too much.
- The fuck that mean?

247
00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:06.925
That mean. if you out here snitchin'.

248
00:16:07.884 --> 00:16:09.844
you gon' pay a price.

249
00:16:11.846 --> 00:16:13.807
If Fame was talkin'.

250
00:16:14.683 --> 00:16:16.393
he got what he deserve.

251
00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.312
He was your best fuckin' friend.

252
00:16:20.355 --> 00:16:22.857
I ain't worryin' about niggas who gone.

